================================================================================
 WHAT PRODUCED THIS LOG
================================================================================

The fix in lib/courier/workers/dispatch_webhooks_worker.ex with the
Courier.Tenancy.with_account/3 wrapper around WebhookEndpoints.enabled/1
DELETED — the state this packet started from. Nothing else changed. The tree
was restored afterwards with `git checkout HEAD -- <file>` and the byte
comparison is in REPORT-courier-queue-identity-01.md section 5.

The two FAILs above are the whole reason this file exists as a gate rather than
a note. On this tree:

  * this harness              13 passed,  2 failed   (exit 1)
  * dispatch_webhooks_worker_identity_test.exs   1 passed, 3 failed
  * dispatch_webhooks_worker_test.exs           17 passed, 0 FAILED

The third line is the finding. The worker suite that has been green for the
whole life of this defect stays green with the identity deleted, because
config/test.exs connects as postgres and postgres is rolbypassrls=t. A suite
that cannot fail is not evidence, and this is the measurement of that rather
than an assertion about it.
